"Always redirects every call immediately. When Busy applies while you are on "
"another call, When Unanswered after the phone has rung for the chosen time, "
"and When Unreachable when the phone is off or out of coverage.\n"
"\n"
"Enter numbers in international format, for example +358401234567. Applying "
"an empty number turns that rule off."
msgstr "Jaqukipañax redan lurasi telefonomar purinkipana.\n\n«Wiñaya» ukax taqi jawsäwinak jank'akiw jaqukipi. «Luräwin ukhaxa» yaqha jawsäwin ukhaxa irnaqi, «Jan jaysata ukhaxa» telefono ajllit pacha ch'illkipana, ukat «Jan jikxatasiñapana» telefono ch'amakt'ata jan ukax redan jan utjkipana.\n\nJakhuwinak markanakpachan qillqt'am, sañäni +358401234567. Mä ch'usa jakhuwi uchasta ukhaxa uka kamachix ch'amakt'ayata."

