#: src/telephony/client/ui/windows/settings_window.py:727
msgid ""
"Enter the URL you want to use for searching unknown numbers. Include "
"'{number}' in the URL where the caller's phone number should go.\n"
"\n"
"For example: https://mysearch.com/?q={number}\n"
"\n"
"When you tap the search button during a call, we will replace '{number}' "
"with the actual phone number and open it in your default browser."
msgstr ""
"URL ukax jan uñt’at jakhunak thaqhañatakiw apnaqañ munkta uk qillqt’aña. URL "
"ukanx '{number}' ukar uñt'ayañaw kawkhantix jawsirin teléfono jakhupax "
"sarañapa.\n"
"\n"
"Amuyt’añataki: https://mysearch.com/?q={number}\n"
"\n"
"Kunawsatix mä jawsañ pachanx thaqhañ botón ukar ch’iqt’apk ukhax ‘{number}’ "
"chiqpach teléfono jakhumpiw turkañäni ukatx nayrïr navegador ukan "
"jist’arañäni."

