msgstr "Wiñay jikxatasiñapa, SIM jan utjkipansa"

#: src/telephony/client/ui/windows/settings_window.py:844
msgid ""
"This is the call volume for each output. The level applies automatically "
"when a call connects and whenever the output changes during a call, and "
"slider changes are heard live. The hardware applies levels in coarse steps, "
"and the earpiece never goes fully silent. Bluetooth and USB levels apply "
"when those call routes are active."
msgstr "Akax sapa mistuñ chiqan jawsäwi ch'illkiwipawa. Jawsäwix mayachasi ukhaw ukhamaraki jawsäwi sarantaskipan mistuñ chiqa mayjt'i ukhaw nivelax pachpat irnaqi, ukat slider mayjt'awix jank'akiw ist'asi. Hardwarex nivelanak jach'a t'aqanakanw uchi, ukat ist'aña chiqax janipuniw taqpach ch'usaptkiti. Bluetooth ukhamaraki USB nivelanakax uka jawsäwi thakhinakax irnaqkipanaw irnaqi."

#: src/telephony/client/ui/windows/settings_window.py:847
msgid ""
"When enabled, the network is asked to confirm when your text and multimedia "
"messages reach the recipient's phone.\n"
"\n"
"A confirmation is reliable when it arrives, but many carriers and automated "
"senders never produce one, so a message without a confirmation may still "
"have been delivered. Delivered never means read."
msgstr "Qhanart'ata ukhaxa, redar mayisi qillqat ukhamaraki multimedia apaytanakam katuqirin telefonopar purinki uk chiqanchañapataki.\n\nChiqanchäwix puri ukhaxa atinitawa, ukampis walja empresanaka ukhamaraki pachpat apayirinakax janipuniw mä chiqanchäwi lurkiti, ukatwa jan chiqanchäwimp apaytax purjaspawa. «Katuyata» ukax janipuniw «ullata» sañ munkiti."

